    "text": "Mr. Knightley invites everyone to pick {STRAWBERRIES} at Donwell Abbey. Mrs. Elton, in a large bonnet, {CHATTERS} until the heat wears her out. Jane slips away early, walking {HOME} alone, {AGITATED}. Frank arrives late, cross and {OVERHEATED}, and only Emma can {SOOTHE} him.",
